      "title": "HTTP: Add expert warnings for malformed header syntax",
      "message": "HTTP: Add expert warnings for malformed header syntax\n\nAdd expert warnings for two malformed HTTP header conditions:\n\n* Whitespace before the header field colon.\n* Embedded NUL bytes in header values.\n\nThese warnings help identify malformed header syntax that may\nlead to inconsistent handling by different HTTP implementations.\n\nUse PI_PROTOCOL severity since dissection can continue despite\nthe syntax violations.\n\nAdd a regression test covering both conditions.\n",
      "author_name": "Urval Kheni",
      "author_email": "kheniurval777@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2026-06-19T00:16:41.000+05:30",
      "committer_name": "Urval Kheni",
      "committer_email": "kheniurval777@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2026-06-27T08:06:26.000+05:30",
